lookahead_flag: none — OLS uses contemporaneous aligned returns only; do not shift(-1) prices into signals.

=== friction checklist (≥5) ===
1. bid-ask spread
2. commissions / fees
3. slippage / market impact
4. borrow / financing costs
5. latency / delayed fills
6. taxes / stamp duties (venue-dependent)

=== three-sentence research goal (template filled) ===
GOAL: On synthetic daily equity-like closes (n=252), test whether a pre-registered rule improves constrained risk-adjusted performance vs a buy-and-hold benchmark after costs.
CONSTRAINTS: Max 100% gross exposure; declare Rf=0 and √252 annualization; no look-ahead fills.
SUCCESS: Net Sharpe and max drawdown beat the benchmark on a frozen hold-out block — reproducible from seed+CSV.
